msgid "--relay-only cannot be combined with --to-addr (direct IP hints)"
msgstr "--relay-only no se puede combinar con --to-addr (sugerencias de IP directa)"

msgid "Disable IP transports (no hole-punch / LAN direct); traffic stays on relay. Set on both peers for a reliable baseline. Conflicts with --to-addr. Also LINK_P2P_RELAY_ONLY."
msgstr "Desactiva transportes IP (sin hole-punch / LAN directo); el tráfico permanece en relay. Ambos peers deben activarlo para una línea base fiable. Es incompatible con --to-addr. También LINK_P2P_RELAY_ONLY."

msgid "Use a custom relay server instead of n0's public one, e.g. http://127.0.0.1:3340 (run `iroh-relay --dev` locally). Skips n0 DNS/pkarr discovery. Does NOT disable hole-punch — use --relay-only for a true relay-only baseline. Also LINK_P2P_RELAY."
msgstr "Usar un relay personalizado en lugar del público de n0, p. ej. http://127.0.0.1:3340 (ejecuta `iroh-relay --dev` localmente). Omite el descubrimiento DNS/pkarr de n0. NO desactiva el hole-punch: usa --relay-only para una línea base solo-relay. También LINK_P2P_RELAY."

msgid ""
"creating TUN device failed (needs Administrator).\n"
